{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"30a2f878-5f07-44de-809f-956f925a7ba5","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":683972,"messageId":683972,"newsId":636557,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - third tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the third tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 22 July 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 23 July to no later than 26 October 2026.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 22 July 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/678529\n\nFrom 5 October to 9 October 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of 708,444\nown shares at an average price of NOK 408.3895 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Date             |Trading    |              |       Daily|                    |\n|                 |venue      |    Aggregated|    weighted|                    |\n|                 |           |  daily volume|     average|         Total daily|\n|                 |           |    (number of| share price|   transaction value|\n|                 |           |       shares)|       (NOK)|               (NOK)|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|5 October        |OSE        |       145,000|    405.7887|       58,839,361.50|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+----------------