     |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|9 October        |OSE        |       139,000|    412.8629|       57,387,943.10|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total for the    |OSE        |              |            |                    |\n|period           |           |       708,444|    408.3895|      289,321,074.28|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Previously       |OSE        |     6,989,388|    395.3214|    2,763,054,786.45|\n|disclosed buy-   +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|backs under the  |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|tranche          +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     6,989,388|    395.3214|    2,763,054,786.45|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |           |              |            |                    |\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|Total buy-backs  |OSE        |     7,697,832|    396.5241|    3,052,375,860.73|\n|under the tranche+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|(accumulated)    |CEUX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |TQEX       |              |            |                    |\n|                 +-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n|                 |Total      |     7,697,832|    396.5241|    3,052,375,860.73|\n+-----------------+-----------+--------------+------------+--------------------+\n\n\nFollowing completion of the above transactions, Equinor ASA owns a total of\n22,332,567 own shares, corresponding to 0.93% of Equinor ASA's share capital,\nincluding shares under Equinor's share savings programme (excluding shares under\nEquinor's share savings programme, Equinor owns a total of 11,232,807 own\nshares, corresponding to 0.47% of the share capital).\n\nThis is information that Equinor ASA is obliged to make public pursuant to the\nEU Market Abuse Regulation and that is subject to the disclosure requirements\npursuant to Section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act.\n\nAppendix: An overview of all transactions made under the buy-back tranche that\nhave been carried out during the above-mentioned time period is attached to this\nreport and available at www.newsweb.no.\n\nContact details:\n\n